{
  "_comment": "Pest knowledge for Field Scouting. 'groups' = farmer-facing pest groups with management advice. 'labels' maps every training label to a display name and group: ip102:<index> for the 102 IP102 species (index = line in IP102 classes.txt minus 1) and agripests:<folder> for the Agricultural Pests dataset classes. Used by scripts/prepare_pests_ip102.py, training/pest_ip102/train.py and the field service.",
